abstract: >-
  A deterministic, two-engine (TypeScript reference + Rust/WASM authority)
  artificial-life sandbox for the reproducible study of emergence: fractal
  escape-time worlds, neural agents, evolutionary game theory, and a full
  research/measurement stack (detectors, statistics, benchmarks, Bayesian
  ledgers, and LLM-assisted experiment proposal).
